    solid-memo:distractorText "It rejects the patch with 422 as malformed"@en ;
    solid-memo:distractorNote "422 is for a patch that breaks the format rules; this patch is well formed."@en .

<#q-read-write-8b>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 5 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:textFormat solid-memo:markdown ;
    solid-memo:front "You send a Solid N3 Patch with only `solid:inserts` to a URL where no document exists yet. What happens on a conforming server?"@en ;
    solid-memo:back "The document is created, containing the inserted triples"@en ;
    solid-memo:backNote "N3 Patch processing begins with the target's triples, or an empty graph if the resource does not exist, so an insert-only PATCH can create a document."@en ;
