    solid-memo:front "Your Solid app must let a user share one document with a friend, on both WAC and ACP pods. Which single API call is *meant* to do this on both?"@en ;
    solid-memo:back "The universal access API's `setAgentAccess`"@en ;
    solid-memo:backNote "The universal access API is meant to hide whether a pod uses WAC or ACP, but check the result: on a fresh CSS 7.2 ACP resource (2026) it returned `null` and shared nothing. Then fall back to writing the rule yourself."@en ;
    solid-memo:distractor <#q-sharing-r04-d1> ,
