    solid-memo:textFormat solid-memo:markdown ;
    solid-memo:front "Compared with a Solid app that uses type indexes, what does a Solid Application Interoperability (SAI) app ask for?"@en ;
    solid-memo:back "Access to data by shape tree, granted by the user's agent."@en ;
    solid-memo:backNote "In SAI the agreement moves from \"where\" and \"what class\" to \"what shaped tree of data\", and the user's Authorization Agent decides and issues the grants."@en ;
    solid-memo:distractor <#q-interop-8a-d1> ,
                          <#q-interop-8a-d2> ,
                          <#q-interop-8a-d3> .

