    solid-memo:back "It adds a new subject, `<#reg-notes-…>`; `<#notes>` stays as it was"@en ;
    solid-memo:backNote "An insert into an existing subject merges with it, so the app inserts under a fragment no other app is likely to use; on CSS 7.2 `<#notes>` still registered only `schema:Recipe` afterwards."@en ;
