    solid-memo:front """A Solid app's `editNote(url, change, fetch)` reads a note, writes `change(text)` with `If-Match`, and on a 412 rereads and calls `change` with the fresh text. The note says `Shopping`; another user appends a line `milk` before the first PATCH arrives. What does the note say after this call?

