    solid-memo:front "Where does the Solid Notes example app store the text description of a PNG it uploaded to a Solid pod?"@en ;
    solid-memo:back "In the resource the PNG's `describedby` link points to, via N3 Patch"@en ;
    solid-memo:backNote "A binary resource's metadata lives in its description resource, found through `Link` `rel=\"describedby\"`, and is edited with an N3 Patch."@en ;
    solid-memo:distractor <#q-read-an-app-8a-d1> ,
                          <#q-read-an-app-8a-d2> ,
                          <#q-read-an-app-8a-d3> .

