    solid-memo:front "A Solid inbox message says alice shared her public profile document with bob. Bob's app checks that the document lies in alice's storage and that bob's own fetch gets it with a 2xx. If both checks pass, what does that show?"@en ;
    solid-memo:back "The document is in alice's storage and bob may read it"@en ;
    solid-memo:backNote "The check rules out a private note never shared and a page in someone else's pod, but not who wrote the message; on CSS 7.2 a forged message about alice's public profile passed it."@en ;
    solid-memo:distractor <#q-read-an-app-10c-d1> ,
                          <#q-read-an-app-10c-d2> ,
