    solid-memo:back "`default-src 'self'` also covers styles, and inline ones aren't `'self'`"@en ;
    solid-memo:backNote "Without a `style-src` directive the browser uses `default-src`, and `'self'` allows files from the app's origin but no inline styles."@en ;
    solid-memo:distractor <#q-read-an-app-17a-d1> ,
