    solid-memo:front """After a login at `https://idp.example`, a Solid app's issuer check fails because the WebID profile lists `https://other.example/` and `https://idp.example/` (exact strings differ). Which provider does this function suggest?

```js
const bare = (url) => url.replace(/\\/+$/, '');
const suggest = result.listed.find((i) => bare(i) === bare(result.issuer))
  ?? result.listed[0] ?? null;
```"""@en ;
